<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>A large truck blocks the view of every vehicle behind it. Drivers who want to overtake often have no idea what is ahead, and they only learn about a turn or a sudden stop when it is almost too late.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>A screen that speaks to the road</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>To improve road safety, we are integrating large LCD screens on the back of trucks. These screens display live camera feeds from the front of the truck, turn signals, and alert messages to the vehicles following behind.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>The result is better communication and visibility, especially during overtakes and lane changes, the moments when many highway accidents happen.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Part of a smart truck</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Rear LCD displays join GPS trackers and drones in our smart hardware line. We plan to offer them on a hardware-as-a-service basis, so logistics companies can adopt advanced safety technology without large upfront costs.</p></div>
